teさん\n考えるだけで楽しい←\n豪華だあ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人に教えられないことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nあってもここで言えないよ(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知しますが\n乃木坂浪漫\n明日です(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと滑舌悪いのとか\nもう考えないで見てください←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nれいか誕生日おめ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかは責任感強いとこあるから\n最初は\nキャプテンとして頑張らなくちゃ\nって頑張りすぎて\nいっぱいいっぱいだったように思ったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暫定なんかついてるの忘れるくらい\n今キャプテンとして全然できてるし\nれいかがキャプテンにぴったりな存在だと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田ごときは支えられる存在ではないが\nこれからもがんばろうね！\nおめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-19904":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/08/17/7072711/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーわーー(´°ω°`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんの記事書く前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2014"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演のこと書いても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいですかーーーー？泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーらりん推しの方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に申し訳ないっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、きっとね、ライブの内容に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついて書いちゃうとネタバレ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しちゃうからきっと引っかかっちゃう"},